      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Kit stops telling you the same thing four times. Its background watchers ran once per server worker, each with its own idea of what it had already said, so a single event could produce four notifications, twice inside the same second on a bad day. One watcher now holds the job and the rest stand by.</li></ul>]]></description>
